@startuml ecs_before_summary
' 요약판 — ECS 적용 전 (feat/enemy). 상세판: ecs_before.puml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK KR"
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBorderColor #546E7A
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  LifeLineBorderColor #B0BEC5
  ArrowColor #C62828
  GroupBorderColor #90A4AE
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8E1
  BorderColor #FFB300
}
hide footbox

title <size:20><b>적용 전</b></size>  총알 한 발 = 이벤트 연쇄

participant "Unity" as U #ECEFF1
participant "Projectile\nService" as PS
participant "Health" as H
participant "Enemy\nController" as E
participant "Session\nService" as S
participant "Player\nController" as P

note over U, P
  서버 FixedUpdate 3곳(Player · Enemy · Projectile)의 <b>순서를 정하는 코드가 없다</b>
end note

U -[#78909C]> PS : FixedUpdate\n<color:#C62828>if (!IsServer) return</color>
activate PS
PS -> H : <b>① ApplyDamage</b>\n<color:#C62828>if (!IsServer) return</color>
activate H
H -> E : <b>② event Died</b>
activate E
E -> S : <b>③ AddReward</b>
activate S
S -> P : <b>④ event ExpChanged</b>
activate P
P -> H : <b>⑤ SetMax</b> (레벨업 시)
deactivate P
deactivate S
E -> E : <b>Despawn()</b>\n순회 도중 즉시
deactivate E
deactivate H
deactivate PS

note over PS, P
  ①~⑤가 <b>한 호출 스택 안</b>에서 일어나고,
  <color:#C62828><b>역할 분기</b></color>가 매 틱 로직 안에 섞여 있다
end note
@enduml
